# 06_biascorrection.py
#
# DISEASE BAG PREDICTION - RAW + CN TRAINING-STYLE AGE BIAS CORRECTION
#
# Uses <MODEL_ROOT>/<Organ>/preprocessing_artifacts.json from 02_model_training
# so CN correction and disease application use the same high-missingness rule and
# train-median imputation as model training.

